        "created_at": "2021-04-04T22:02:58.362Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hey,</p>\n<p>My absolute favorite thing about Spirit Island is how well themes and mechanics mix. I recently played my first batch of legacy games and found them way more enjoyable then expected. It would be cool is there was some type of offshoot legacy game for spirit island. Maybe some similar aspects to creating your own spirit but with more directed “upgrades.” Anyways, pie in the sky dream, but would love to hear other people’s thoughts.</p>",
